   "licence_note": "The pack's material file for this skin (not kept, not used) is MakeHuman's own 2016 material for its young_african_female skin, reused with its header: \"Copyright (C) 2016 Data Collection AB ... This file is licensed AGPLv3\"; and the pack's record calls the atlas a changed copy of that MakeHuman skin. The atlas is read as CC0 all the same, on two statements: the pack's record of this asset says \"license\": \"CC0\" (its author's choice at upload, kept in skins01.original.json), and MakeHuman released the skin it was made from as CC0 in September 2020 (the system assets pack's skins/young_african_female/young_african_female.mhmat, SHA-256 f7e0726cb1c4f1f3dd23e5143f2d91a7c69ddd782a8b1de153a36e1549028b5c: \"This asset was explicitly released as CC0 in september 2020\"). The 2016 header is that of a settings file copied as a template, older than both.",
